{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_2E22F537","title":"Danny first meeting","entry":"Dlg_2E22F537::entry","exit":"Dlg_2E22F537::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_5B536BC6","articyId":"72057624102700839","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"Hey, I'm Danny of Danny's Downtown Donuts. You're the one with the new stall, right?","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey, I'm Danny of Danny's Downtown Donuts. You're the one with the new stall, right?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42039","byteOffset":30230632,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_99805BEC","articyId":"72057624102700852","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"Should I run over and grab you a donut? Today's specials are seaweed and caramel, or we got the peach cream with protein jelly cubes.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Should I run over and grab you a donut? Today's specials are seaweed and caramel, or we got the peach cream with protein jelly cubes.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46386","byteOffset":31882592,"byteLength":480}},{"id":"DFr_B471BB98","articyId":"72057624102700873","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"I'll set one aside for ya.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'll set one aside for ya.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":-125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34233","byteOffset":20834144,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_4A6DE406","articyId":"72057624102700880","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"Maybe the secret menu, then? Bonito fish flakes and caramelized fluoride gel. You gotta taste these!","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Maybe the secret menu, then? Bonito fish flakes and caramelized fluoride gel. You gotta taste these!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37318","byteOffset":28458048,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_A6260B68","articyId":"72057624102700894","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"You know, the other folks down here said you was real scum. But nah, you're alright kid. I mean, you're no Danny Danetti, but who is?!","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You know, the other folks down here said you was real scum. But nah, you're alright kid. I mean, you're no Danny Danetti, but who is?!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":-125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45813","byteOffset":31664544,"byteLength":480}},{"id":"DFr_33860C45","articyId":"72057624102700923","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"Right! There's a lot of gossip down here, but I got your back. I'll look out for ya when it comes to the other guys.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Right! There's a lot of gossip down here, but I got your back. I'll look out for ya when it comes to the other guys.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":-250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22445","byteOffset":16376248,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_67C7B160","articyId":"72057624102700947","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"Good? Just good? They're the best!","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Good? Just good? They're the best!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4200.0,"y":-250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30591","byteOffset":19453176,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_E227B6D0","articyId":"72057624102700954","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"Haha, I like your attitude. Nothing wrong with some rivalry - but you ain't gonna beat old Danny Danetti. No way!","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Haha, I like your attitude. Nothing wrong with some rivalry - but you ain't gonna beat old Danny Danetti. No way!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4200.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22714","byteOffset":16478096,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_00E40E9F","articyId":"72057624102700970","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"Well, I gotta get back to work. Got a lot to do before I launch my franchise! Old Danny will see you later kid.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, I gotta get back to work. Got a lot to do before I launch my franchise! Old Danny will see you later kid.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4800.0,"y":-125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40456","byteOffset":29633160,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_009D23F6","articyId":"72057606922841892","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"But seriously, don't.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"But seriously, don't.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3600.0,"y":-250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49620","byteOffset":33114600,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_9E090C07","articyId":"72057606922841902","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"Come by soon and I'll hook you up with a free donut. You need all the friends - and sugar - you can get down here!","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Come by soon and I'll hook you up with a free donut. You need all the friends - and sugar - you can get down here!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5100.0,"y":-125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26419","byteOffset":17876592,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_94D37D0A","articyId":"72057821671314898","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Danny Danetti","text":"Just don't steal my customers, right?! Haha.","speakerId":"Ntt_BB92D958","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Just don't steal my customers, right?! Haha.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":-250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30789","byteOffset":19528904,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_F2B08A85","articyId":"72057624102700845